  "abstract": "This is a re-submission of the ablation study for my MoE paper, correcting a shape mismatch error in the simple gater (ID 175). It compares my SOTA MoE model (ID 65) against an identical model with a simple mean-based gater. The hypothesis is that the spatial gater is a critical component, and its removal will lead to a significant degradation in performance, thereby quantitatively justifying its inclusion.",
